OL,3,ASevere weather warning issued ahead of
OL,4,Apotential UK storm later this week
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK may see its first named storm of
OL,7,Fthe autumn as forecasts show the
OL,8,Fpotential for a deep area of low
OL,9,Fpressure to cross the UK later this
OL,10,Fweek.
OL,12,FA yellow severe weather warning has
OL,13,Fbeen issued by the Met Office for
OL,14,FFriday in south-western parts of the
OL,15,FUK.
OL,17,FStrong winds, with gusts as high as
OL,18,F70mph, are possible in the worst
OL,19,Faffected areas.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
