OL,3,ASevere weather warning issued ahead of
OL,4,Apotential UK storm later this week
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe whole of the UK will experience
OL,7,Frain at times, including places
OL,8,Fcurrently in drought, but amounts will
OL,9,Fdepend on the exact track of a stormy
OL,10,Flow pressure system from late Thursday.
